           After reading a card's debt, if other main cards remain unread I'll ask if they want to check another card; otherwise for the no-debt branch I'll route directly to the main menu with an end-call message, and otherwise offer email options for both cards.
           
           I'm deciding to fetch the email at the start right after cards.list so it only gets called once, storing an error state if it fails rather than repeating the call later; if email.get failed, after reading the debt I'll say the reading plus the line about transferring to a representative. The flow nodes are: init parses code, then cards_list API call, then email_get API call, then an after_list code node that parses cards and email to decide the selection prompt or auto-select a card, branching into no-card-end or list-based paths.
           
